{"content": "# 認識\n![float-right](./api/kotoba/met/thumbnails/webp/architecture.webp?v=f43cb24a6d3969ea#full=./projects/archive/02_kotoba/articles/01_met/architecture.webp?v=6a1a74b86c4e3f24&w=1638&h=1638)\n\n<div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n<button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-1', this, 'Group')\">交會</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-2', this, 'Group')\">Met</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-3', this, 'Group')\">逢う時</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-1\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: block;\">\n\n「我和你的認識，適逢與你的告別。」\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-2\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"lang-en\">\n\n“We met — just in time to say goodbye.”\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-3\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n:::lang[ja]\n「最初の言葉は、『さよなら』だった。」\n:::\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"md-tab-end\"></div>"}